* LTC6078 Unity-Gain Follower
.lib LTC5.lib

* Single 5V Power Supply
VCC VCC 0 5V

* Input Signal: 1 kHz, 100 mV amplitude sine wave
* Biased at 2.5V DC to accommodate the single 5V supply
VIN IN 0 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k) AC 1

* LTC6078 configured as a unity-gain voltage follower
* Pinout: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
X1 IN OUT VCC 0 OUT LTC6078

* 10k Load Resistor
RL OUT 0 10k

* Analyses
.tran 0 5m
.ac dec 20 10 100k

* Measurement for gain in dB at 1 kHz
.meas AC gain_db FIND 20*log10(mag(V(OUT)/V(IN))) AT 1k

.end
